# OPTIONAL override of the bundled default Google OAuth client.
#
# The build already ships with a working default client id
# (tooling/mod/default-client-id.txt) — you do NOT need to set anything here.
# Only fill this in to use your OWN Google client instead of the default.
#
# Use an "iOS" OAuth client (Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials
# → Create credentials → OAuth client ID → Application type: iOS; Bundle ID
# e.g. com.readestgmod.app). It carries NO client secret and needs NO SHA-1 —
# the reverse-DNS redirect + PKCE are the authentication. The SAME one client
# works on both Windows and Android.
#
# Enter it in the patcher GUI (recommended) or copy this file to `credentials.env`
# and fill it in. The real `credentials.env` is gitignored and never uploaded.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
